    "v_f1443739b13b024f_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 513.375,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集说到一九四八年，钱三强放弃了法国的一切，抱着半岁的女儿带着十几箱器材和图书。在海上颠簸了一个月，零两天回到了一穷二白的中国。很多人以为末奖级的科学家回国，肯定是要风得风，要雨得雨。没有，当时中国的原子能事业是一张白纸，要设备、没设备、要资料、没资料，连螺丝刀电阻都难以寻觅。钱三强带着人跑遍北京的旧货市场和废品站，搜罗可用零件动手组装仪器，造出了改革计数器、静电加速器等关键设备。但钱三强回国后，做的最重要的一件事，不是搞科研，是找人。一九五八年，钱三强把邓稼先叫到办公室，说了一句话，小邓国家要放一个大炮仗，准备调你去做这项工作。邓稼先从此隐姓埋名了。二十八年，一九六一年，他又找到了渔民。俞敏当时只是个副研究员，没有留过洋，很多人不服，但钱三强力排众议，押上自己的信誉，把清淡理论预先研究的重担交给了他。后来，于敏被称为中国清弹之父，你知道这意味着什么吗？二十三位两弹一星元勋中有十五位是前三强动员回国的，其中七位是他直接推荐到核武器研制第一线的邓稼先、王淦昌、彭焕武、朱光亚、周光昭。这些后来撑起中国和天空的名字，个个都受过他的举荐与支持。美国情报部门摸清这一点之后才明白，就算你炸掉一座研究所，一个试验基地，只要这支人才队伍还在，中国的核计划就永远炸不了，这正是他们最后不敢贸然动手的关键原因。前三强最狠的一步棋是提前布局，清淡。原子弹还在艰难攻关的时候，他就判定氢弹原理与原子弹完全不同，绝不能等原子弹成功再启动。他悄悄组建团队，提前开展预言，还同步布局了放射化学、核数据、工程、物理等配套领域，把整个研发的全链条都提前铺好了。正是这部先手棋换来了中国从原子弹到氢弹，仅用了二年八个月的世界奇迹。这个速度记录至今没有其他国家能打破。一九六四年。十月十六日，罗布泊内上空腾起蘑菇云，中国第一颗原子弹爆炸成功。你知道这一天是什么日子吗？这一天，恰好是前三强五十一岁的生日，他没有去罗布泊现场，他守在收音机前，听到爆炸成功的消息后，没笑他哭了，可你知道三天后发生了什么吗？三天后，他拎着简单的行李坐上了南下河南的火车被下放到信阳农村插队。劳动举国欢腾的时候，他在南下的火车上。在乡下，他一边下地干农活，一边用知识帮乡亲们做事，牵头建起小型化肥生产装置，修好村里的农机和发电设备，还教年轻人学知识、学文化，身边人为他抱不平。他总说，国家的事成了个人受点，委屈不算什么。他亲手选出来的人，在戈壁滩创造历史。他自己在乡间田野里耗掉了科研生涯最黄金的时机。几年对自己苛刻，对家人更严。儿子下乡插队写信，想让家里帮忙调回城市前三强，前前后后回了一百多封信。没有一封是托关系走后门的，句句都是让孩子自立。人生的路要自己走，靠父母没出息。句个子女，后来全凭自己的努力，考上顶尖大学，没一个沾过他的光。重回北京后，他一就简朴如初，组织多次提出给他换更好的住方。他次次谢绝了，说老房子离图书馆近，家里的沙发弹簧塌了，用布条缠了又缠，冬天穿洗的发白的旧棉袄挤公交上下班。有一回，他和何泽慧去照相馆拍照，摄影师看着眼前衣着朴素的两位老人，还打去何泽慧大妈好福气，是出国看儿女吧。他哪里知道眼前这对普通老人，一个是中国核科学的奠基人，一个是享誉世界的物理学家。一九九二年六月二十八日，七十九岁的钱三强在北京离世，走的前一天晚上，他还在书房修改发言稿，熬到了凌晨。一九九九年，国家隆重表彰两弹一星功勋科学家，追授前三强功勋奖章。这时候，他已经离开整整七年了。老同事彭黄武捧着沉甸甸的证书，和何泽慧一起来到墓碑前，把获奖词一字一句念完，深深鞠了三个躬，一份迟到七年的荣誉，他连亲手摸一摸的机会都没有。搭台子的是他出路的，是他默默扛下风雨的，是他不争不抢的，还是他举国欢腾的时候，他在南下的火车上勋章，搬下来的时候，他已经长眠地下，他的墓碑上刻着父亲送他的那四个字。从牛到爱，我们今天能安安稳稳过日子，靠的从来不是运气，是前三强。这样的老一辈拿一辈子的隐忍奉献和牺牲一点点拼出来的底气。其实像钱三强这样的人，还有很多，他们干着惊天动地的事，做着隐姓埋名的人，不求名不求利，就想让后世子孙能挺直腰杆做人。如果你想知道更多他们的故事，推荐你看看国之脊梁。这本书，书里记录了几十位为新中国立下汗马功劳的科学家和建设者。有我们熟悉的名字，也有像钱三强这样功劳不赏，常常被忽略，却同样不该被遗忘的人。每一个名字背后都是一段拿命拼出来的传奇。读完你会明白，今天的安稳日子不是天上掉下来的。是有人用一辈子替我们扛下来的。点下方链接，把这本书带回家，自己读也给孩子读，让我们的下一代知道谁才是真正该追的星。他一辈子都在做别人的铺路石，可没有这些卵石，哪来的康庄大盗点赞是给前三强们迟来的掌声。收藏是怕以后再也找不到这样的故事。转发是让更多人知道谁才是真正的国之脊。俩。关注我，咱们一起把该记住的人一个一个讲完。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 4330,
      "text": "上集说到一九四八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5090,
      "end_ms": 7570,
      "text": "钱三强放弃了法国的一切，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00003",
      "start_ms": 8390,
      "end_ms": 12950,
      "text": "抱着半岁的女儿带着十几箱器材和图书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00004",
      "start_ms": 13930,
      "end_ms": 16490,
      "text": "在海上颠簸了一个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00005",
      "start_ms": 16830,
      "end_ms": 19890,
      "text": "零两天回到了一穷二白的中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00006",
      "start_ms": 20790,
      "end_ms": 24330,
      "text": "很多人以为末奖级的科学家回国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00007",
      "start_ms": 24530,
      "end_ms": 25950,
      "text": "肯定是要风得风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00008",
      "start_ms": 25950,
      "end_ms": 26710,
      "text": "要雨得雨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00009",
      "start_ms": 28230,
      "end_ms": 28690,
      "text": "没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00010",
      "start_ms": 29010,
      "end_ms": 32585,
      "text": "当时中国的原子能事业是一张白纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00011",
      "start_ms": 33490,
      "end_ms": 36050,
      "text": "要设备、没设备、要资料、没资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00012",
      "start_ms": 36530,
      "end_ms": 40010,
      "text": "连螺丝刀电阻都难以寻觅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00013",
      "start_ms": 40930,
      "end_ms": 45270,
      "text": "钱三强带着人跑遍北京的旧货市场和废品站，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00014",
      "start_ms": 45370,
      "end_ms": 48550,
      "text": "搜罗可用零件动手组装仪器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00015",
      "start_ms": 48950,
      "end_ms": 53110,
      "text": "造出了改革计数器、静电加速器等关键设备。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00016",
      "start_ms": 53530,
      "end_ms": 55130,
      "text": "但钱三强回国后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00017",
      "start_ms": 55170,
      "end_ms": 56930,
      "text": "做的最重要的一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00018",
      "start_ms": 57290,
      "end_ms": 58430,
      "text": "不是搞科研，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00019",
      "start_ms": 59030,
      "end_ms": 59955,
      "text": "是找人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00020",
      "start_ms": 60730,
      "end_ms": 61650,
      "text": "一九五八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00021",
      "start_ms": 61910,
      "end_ms": 64255,
      "text": "钱三强把邓稼先叫到办公室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00022",
      "start_ms": 64590,
      "end_ms": 65365,
      "text": "说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00023",
      "start_ms": 65710,
      "end_ms": 68175,
      "text": "小邓国家要放一个大炮仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00024",
      "start_ms": 68550,
      "end_ms": 70515,
      "text": "准备调你去做这项工作。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00025",
      "start_ms": 71060,
      "end_ms": 73740,
      "text": "邓稼先从此隐姓埋名了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00026",
      "start_ms": 73860,
      "end_ms": 74735,
      "text": "二十八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00027",
      "start_ms": 75490,
      "end_ms": 76410,
      "text": "一九六一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00028",
      "start_ms": 76570,
      "end_ms": 77775,
      "text": "他又找到了渔民。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00029",
      "start_ms": 78210,
      "end_ms": 80310,
      "text": "俞敏当时只是个副研究员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00030",
      "start_ms": 80490,
      "end_ms": 81430,
      "text": "没有留过洋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00031",
      "start_ms": 81710,
      "end_ms": 82935,
      "text": "很多人不服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00032",
      "start_ms": 83420,
      "end_ms": 85680,
      "text": "但钱三强力排众议，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00033",
      "start_ms": 85960,
      "end_ms": 87465,
      "text": "押上自己的信誉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00034",
      "start_ms": 87750,
      "end_ms": 91645,
      "text": "把清淡理论预先研究的重担交给了他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00035",
      "start_ms": 92210,
      "end_ms": 92690,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00036",
      "start_ms": 92890,
      "end_ms": 96055,
      "text": "于敏被称为中国清弹之父，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00037",
      "start_ms": 96670,
      "end_ms": 98315,
      "text": "你知道这意味着什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00038",
      "start_ms": 98830,
      "end_ms": 105075,
      "text": "二十三位两弹一星元勋中有十五位是前三强动员回国的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00039",
      "start_ms": 105880,
      "end_ms": 115915,
      "text": "其中七位是他直接推荐到核武器研制第一线的邓稼先、王淦昌、彭焕武、朱光亚、周光昭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00040",
      "start_ms": 116400,
      "end_ms": 119700,
      "text": "这些后来撑起中国和天空的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00041",
      "start_ms": 119800,
      "end_ms": 121955,
      "text": "个个都受过他的举荐与支持。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00042",
      "start_ms": 122940,
      "end_ms": 125775,
      "text": "美国情报部门摸清这一点之后才明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00043",
      "start_ms": 126610,
      "end_ms": 128925,
      "text": "就算你炸掉一座研究所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00044",
      "start_ms": 129490,
      "end_ms": 130665,
      "text": "一个试验基地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00045",
      "start_ms": 131490,
      "end_ms": 133635,
      "text": "只要这支人才队伍还在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00046",
      "start_ms": 134080,
      "end_ms": 136525,
      "text": "中国的核计划就永远炸不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00047",
      "start_ms": 137400,
      "end_ms": 141235,
      "text": "这正是他们最后不敢贸然动手的关键原因。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00048",
      "start_ms": 141950,
      "end_ms": 146310,
      "text": "前三强最狠的一步棋是提前布局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00049",
      "start_ms": 146430,
      "end_ms": 147035,
      "text": "清淡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00050",
      "start_ms": 147440,
      "end_ms": 150065,
      "text": "原子弹还在艰难攻关的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00051",
      "start_ms": 150510,
      "end_ms": 154245,
      "text": "他就判定氢弹原理与原子弹完全不同，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00052",
      "start_ms": 154750,
      "end_ms": 157570,
      "text": "绝不能等原子弹成功再启动。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00053",
      "start_ms": 157650,
      "end_ms": 159350,
      "text": "他悄悄组建团队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00054",
      "start_ms": 159870,
      "end_ms": 161485,
      "text": "提前开展预言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00055",
      "start_ms": 162120,
      "end_ms": 168605,
      "text": "还同步布局了放射化学、核数据、工程、物理等配套领域，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00056",
      "start_ms": 169010,
      "end_ms": 172875,
      "text": "把整个研发的全链条都提前铺好了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00057",
      "start_ms": 173390,
      "end_ms": 178640,
      "text": "正是这部先手棋换来了中国从原子弹到氢弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00058",
      "start_ms": 178960,
      "end_ms": 182135,
      "text": "仅用了二年八个月的世界奇迹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00059",
      "start_ms": 183000,
      "end_ms": 187575,
      "text": "这个速度记录至今没有其他国家能打破。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00060",
      "start_ms": 188250,
      "end_ms": 189330,
      "text": "一九六四年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00061",
      "start_ms": 189370,
      "end_ms": 190335,
      "text": "十月十六日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00062",
      "start_ms": 190700,
      "end_ms": 193895,
      "text": "罗布泊内上空腾起蘑菇云，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00063",
      "start_ms": 194310,
      "end_ms": 197245,
      "text": "中国第一颗原子弹爆炸成功。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00064",
      "start_ms": 197840,
      "end_ms": 199600,
      "text": "你知道这一天是什么日子吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00065",
      "start_ms": 199660,
      "end_ms": 200325,
      "text": "这一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00066",
      "start_ms": 200860,
      "end_ms": 203985,
      "text": "恰好是前三强五十一岁的生日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00067",
      "start_ms": 204780,
      "end_ms": 206485,
      "text": "他没有去罗布泊现场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00068",
      "start_ms": 207220,
      "end_ms": 208815,
      "text": "他守在收音机前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00069",
      "start_ms": 209220,
      "end_ms": 211300,
      "text": "听到爆炸成功的消息后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00070",
      "start_ms": 211540,
      "end_ms": 214225,
      "text": "没笑他哭了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00071",
      "start_ms": 214820,
      "end_ms": 217245,
      "text": "可你知道三天后发生了什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00072",
      "start_ms": 218120,
      "end_ms": 219015,
      "text": "三天后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00073",
      "start_ms": 219530,
      "end_ms": 227840,
      "text": "他拎着简单的行李坐上了南下河南的火车被下放到信阳农村插队。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00074",
      "start_ms": 227860,
      "end_ms": 231015,
      "text": "劳动举国欢腾的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00075",
      "start_ms": 231430,
      "end_ms": 233245,
      "text": "他在南下的火车上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00076",
      "start_ms": 233990,
      "end_ms": 234935,
      "text": "在乡下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00077",
      "start_ms": 235680,
      "end_ms": 237815,
      "text": "他一边下地干农活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00078",
      "start_ms": 238500,
      "end_ms": 241510,
      "text": "一边用知识帮乡亲们做事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00079",
      "start_ms": 241690,
      "end_ms": 244810,
      "text": "牵头建起小型化肥生产装置，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00080",
      "start_ms": 245230,
      "end_ms": 248090,
      "text": "修好村里的农机和发电设备，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00081",
      "start_ms": 248510,
      "end_ms": 251270,
      "text": "还教年轻人学知识、学文化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00082",
      "start_ms": 251770,
      "end_ms": 253430,
      "text": "身边人为他抱不平。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00083",
      "start_ms": 254150,
      "end_ms": 254870,
      "text": "他总说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00084",
      "start_ms": 255330,
      "end_ms": 257870,
      "text": "国家的事成了个人受点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00085",
      "start_ms": 257870,
      "end_ms": 258990,
      "text": "委屈不算什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00086",
      "start_ms": 259710,
      "end_ms": 261570,
      "text": "他亲手选出来的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00087",
      "start_ms": 261770,
      "end_ms": 263710,
      "text": "在戈壁滩创造历史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00088",
      "start_ms": 264570,
      "end_ms": 269920,
      "text": "他自己在乡间田野里耗掉了科研生涯最黄金的时机。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00089",
      "start_ms": 269980,
      "end_ms": 271880,
      "text": "几年对自己苛刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00090",
      "start_ms": 272060,
      "end_ms": 273260,
      "text": "对家人更严。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00091",
      "start_ms": 273820,
      "end_ms": 276140,
      "text": "儿子下乡插队写信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00092",
      "start_ms": 276220,
      "end_ms": 279480,
      "text": "想让家里帮忙调回城市前三强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00093",
      "start_ms": 279540,
      "end_ms": 281460,
      "text": "前前后后回了一百多封信。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00094",
      "start_ms": 281560,
      "end_ms": 283740,
      "text": "没有一封是托关系走后门的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00095",
      "start_ms": 284400,
      "end_ms": 286239,
      "text": "句句都是让孩子自立。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00096",
      "start_ms": 287000,
      "end_ms": 288640,
      "text": "人生的路要自己走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00097",
      "start_ms": 289420,
      "end_ms": 290860,
      "text": "靠父母没出息。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00098",
      "start_ms": 291660,
      "end_ms": 292500,
      "text": "句个子女，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00099",
      "start_ms": 292500,
      "end_ms": 294080,
      "text": "后来全凭自己的努力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00100",
      "start_ms": 294100,
      "end_ms": 295400,
      "text": "考上顶尖大学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00101",
      "start_ms": 295900,
      "end_ms": 297380,
      "text": "没一个沾过他的光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00102",
      "start_ms": 297940,
      "end_ms": 299120,
      "text": "重回北京后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00103",
      "start_ms": 299300,
      "end_ms": 301470,
      "text": "他一就简朴如初，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00104",
      "start_ms": 301950,
      "end_ms": 305545,
      "text": "组织多次提出给他换更好的住方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00105",
      "start_ms": 306110,
      "end_ms": 307890,
      "text": "他次次谢绝了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00106",
      "start_ms": 308190,
      "end_ms": 310650,
      "text": "说老房子离图书馆近，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00107",
      "start_ms": 311330,
      "end_ms": 313350,
      "text": "家里的沙发弹簧塌了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00108",
      "start_ms": 313550,
      "end_ms": 315070,
      "text": "用布条缠了又缠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00109",
      "start_ms": 315670,
      "end_ms": 319930,
      "text": "冬天穿洗的发白的旧棉袄挤公交上下班。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00110",
      "start_ms": 320070,
      "end_ms": 320650,
      "text": "有一回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00111",
      "start_ms": 320930,
      "end_ms": 323630,
      "text": "他和何泽慧去照相馆拍照，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00112",
      "start_ms": 324330,
      "end_ms": 328070,
      "text": "摄影师看着眼前衣着朴素的两位老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00113",
      "start_ms": 328310,
      "end_ms": 330990,
      "text": "还打去何泽慧大妈好福气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00114",
      "start_ms": 331290,
      "end_ms": 332670,
      "text": "是出国看儿女吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00115",
      "start_ms": 333190,
      "end_ms": 336360,
      "text": "他哪里知道眼前这对普通老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00116",
      "start_ms": 336860,
      "end_ms": 339700,
      "text": "一个是中国核科学的奠基人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00117",
      "start_ms": 340180,
      "end_ms": 342640,
      "text": "一个是享誉世界的物理学家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00118",
      "start_ms": 343300,
      "end_ms": 345380,
      "text": "一九九二年六月二十八日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00119",
      "start_ms": 345840,
      "end_ms": 348560,
      "text": "七十九岁的钱三强在北京离世，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00120",
      "start_ms": 348980,
      "end_ms": 350300,
      "text": "走的前一天晚上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00121",
      "start_ms": 350540,
      "end_ms": 352620,
      "text": "他还在书房修改发言稿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00122",
      "start_ms": 352800,
      "end_ms": 353820,
      "text": "熬到了凌晨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00123",
      "start_ms": 354300,
      "end_ms": 355440,
      "text": "一九九九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00124",
      "start_ms": 355520,
      "end_ms": 359140,
      "text": "国家隆重表彰两弹一星功勋科学家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00125",
      "start_ms": 359300,
      "end_ms": 361720,
      "text": "追授前三强功勋奖章。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00126",
      "start_ms": 362640,
      "end_ms": 363220,
      "text": "这时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00127",
      "start_ms": 363320,
      "end_ms": 365220,
      "text": "他已经离开整整七年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00128",
      "start_ms": 366440,
      "end_ms": 369925,
      "text": "老同事彭黄武捧着沉甸甸的证书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00129",
      "start_ms": 370460,
      "end_ms": 373005,
      "text": "和何泽慧一起来到墓碑前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00130",
      "start_ms": 373720,
      "end_ms": 376615,
      "text": "把获奖词一字一句念完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00131",
      "start_ms": 377210,
      "end_ms": 378965,
      "text": "深深鞠了三个躬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00132",
      "start_ms": 379670,
      "end_ms": 381865,
      "text": "一份迟到七年的荣誉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00133",
      "start_ms": 382660,
      "end_ms": 385305,
      "text": "他连亲手摸一摸的机会都没有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00134",
      "start_ms": 385920,
      "end_ms": 387990,
      "text": "搭台子的是他出路的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00135",
      "start_ms": 387990,
      "end_ms": 390330,
      "text": "是他默默扛下风雨的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00136",
      "start_ms": 390330,
      "end_ms": 392130,
      "text": "是他不争不抢的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00137",
      "start_ms": 392130,
      "end_ms": 394740,
      "text": "还是他举国欢腾的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00138",
      "start_ms": 394760,
      "end_ms": 396920,
      "text": "他在南下的火车上勋章，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00139",
      "start_ms": 397020,
      "end_ms": 398120,
      "text": "搬下来的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00140",
      "start_ms": 398260,
      "end_ms": 400165,
      "text": "他已经长眠地下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00141",
      "start_ms": 400740,
      "end_ms": 404740,
      "text": "他的墓碑上刻着父亲送他的那四个字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00142",
      "start_ms": 405020,
      "end_ms": 406355,
      "text": "从牛到爱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00143",
      "start_ms": 407260,
      "end_ms": 409875,
      "text": "我们今天能安安稳稳过日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00144",
      "start_ms": 410360,
      "end_ms": 412145,
      "text": "靠的从来不是运气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00145",
      "start_ms": 412530,
      "end_ms": 413450,
      "text": "是前三强。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00146",
      "start_ms": 413530,
      "end_ms": 420535,
      "text": "这样的老一辈拿一辈子的隐忍奉献和牺牲一点点拼出来的底气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00147",
      "start_ms": 421190,
      "end_ms": 423845,
      "text": "其实像钱三强这样的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00148",
      "start_ms": 424530,
      "end_ms": 425450,
      "text": "还有很多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00149",
      "start_ms": 425810,
      "end_ms": 427995,
      "text": "他们干着惊天动地的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00150",
      "start_ms": 428440,
      "end_ms": 430315,
      "text": "做着隐姓埋名的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00151",
      "start_ms": 431440,
      "end_ms": 432820,
      "text": "不求名不求利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00152",
      "start_ms": 432840,
      "end_ms": 436815,
      "text": "就想让后世子孙能挺直腰杆做人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00153",
      "start_ms": 437500,
      "end_ms": 439815,
      "text": "如果你想知道更多他们的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00154",
      "start_ms": 440160,
      "end_ms": 442260,
      "text": "推荐你看看国之脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00155",
      "start_ms": 442280,
      "end_ms": 442955,
      "text": "这本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00156",
      "start_ms": 443680,
      "end_ms": 449405,
      "text": "书里记录了几十位为新中国立下汗马功劳的科学家和建设者。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00157",
      "start_ms": 450020,
      "end_ms": 451735,
      "text": "有我们熟悉的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00158",
      "start_ms": 452170,
      "end_ms": 454670,
      "text": "也有像钱三强这样功劳不赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00159",
      "start_ms": 454730,
      "end_ms": 455875,
      "text": "常常被忽略，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00160",
      "start_ms": 456300,
      "end_ms": 458615,
      "text": "却同样不该被遗忘的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00161",
      "start_ms": 459370,
      "end_ms": 464625,
      "text": "每一个名字背后都是一段拿命拼出来的传奇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00162",
      "start_ms": 465190,
      "end_ms": 466345,
      "text": "读完你会明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00163",
      "start_ms": 466830,
      "end_ms": 470430,
      "text": "今天的安稳日子不是天上掉下来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00164",
      "start_ms": 470430,
      "end_ms": 473895,
      "text": "是有人用一辈子替我们扛下来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00165",
      "start_ms": 474650,
      "end_ms": 475835,
      "text": "点下方链接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00166",
      "start_ms": 476270,
      "end_ms": 477795,
      "text": "把这本书带回家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00167",
      "start_ms": 478360,
      "end_ms": 480595,
      "text": "自己读也给孩子读，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00168",
      "start_ms": 481220,
      "end_ms": 485415,
      "text": "让我们的下一代知道谁才是真正该追的星。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00169",
      "start_ms": 486070,
      "end_ms": 488410,
      "text": "他一辈子都在做别人的铺路石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00170",
      "start_ms": 489370,
      "end_ms": 490570,
      "text": "可没有这些卵石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00171",
      "start_ms": 490910,
      "end_ms": 496910,
      "text": "哪来的康庄大盗点赞是给前三强们迟来的掌声。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00172",
      "start_ms": 497790,
      "end_ms": 501030,
      "text": "收藏是怕以后再也找不到这样的故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00173",
      "start_ms": 501510,
      "end_ms": 507310,
      "text": "转发是让更多人知道谁才是真正的国之脊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00174",
      "start_ms": 507310,
      "end_ms": 507550,
      "text": "俩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00175",
      "start_ms": 509010,
      "end_ms": 509630,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f1443739b13b024f_s00176",
      "start_ms": 509630,
      "end_ms": 513215,
      "text": "咱们一起把该记住的人一个一个讲完。"
    }
  ],
